                                                "sense_id": "8be6d4b2-c878-3385-b76c-dc122270dc18",
                                                "text": "There is CCTV in the coach, so anyone planning to pilfer a flapjack may well be seen!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab2aafe4-c599-4e50-b0eb-8cc10df4f7bb",
                                                "sense_id": "8be6d4b2-c878-3385-b76c-dc122270dc18",
                                                "text": "“I think it’s fair to anticipate that the use of CCTV and facial recognition technology in Hong Kong will begin to look a lot like those in mainland China over time,” she said."
                                            }
